sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Main as Main Process<br/>(GPU trainer)
    participant W0 as Worker 0
    participant W1 as Worker 1
    participant Coll as collate_fn
    participant Buf as Prefetch Buffer

    Main->>W0: request batch (indices)
    Main->>W1: request batch (indices)
    par parallel sample loading
        W0->>W0: __getitem__ x batch_size
        W1->>W1: __getitem__ x batch_size
    end
    W0->>Coll: list of samples
    W1->>Coll: list of samples
    Coll->>Buf: stacked batch tensor
    Coll->>Buf: stacked batch tensor
    Note over Buf: prefetch_factor batches<br/>kept ready in pinned memory
    Buf-->>Main: next(loader) returns batch
    Main->>Main: copy to GPU (non_blocking)
    Note over Main,Buf: workers immediately fetch<br/>the next batches in background
